Subject: [PATCH] Profile::GetMesg: model rewrite accepted by the search
 (generation 22)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 5, generation 22, region 574 (Profile::GetMesg).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8673 -> 0.8662 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s5-1072873/patches/gen_22.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_profile.cpp | 16 +++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_profile.cpp b/src/fit_profile.cpp
index 2799247..3ebb01f 100644
--- a/src/fit_profile.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_profile.cpp
@@ -3058,18 +3058,24 @@ const Profile::MESG Profile::mesgs[MESGS] =
 const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const FIT_UINT16 num)
 {
     static const Profile::MESG* lookup[65536] = {};
-    static bool initialized = false;
+    static int max_num = -1;
 
-    if (!initialized)
+    if (max_num < 0)
     {
+        max_num = 0;
         for (int i = 0; i < MESGS; i++)
         {
-            if (lookup[mesgs[i].num] == NULL)
-                lookup[mesgs[i].num] = &mesgs[i];
+            FIT_UINT16 n = mesgs[i].num;
+            if (lookup[n] == NULL)
+                lookup[n] = &mesgs[i];
+            if (n > max_num)
+                max_num = n;
         }
-        initialized = true;
     }
 
+    if (num > max_num)
+        return NULL;
+
     return lookup[num];
 }
 
